<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Onboarding: the six questions and the summary they produce, plus the notes
    explaining what the suggested setup actually turns on.

    The four schedule notes used to spell the clock times out as literals
    ("22:00 to 06:00"), which ignored the person's 12/24-hour setting - the one
    place TimeText was still being bypassed. They are format strings now, filled
    from TimeText like every other clock in the app.
-->
